  "description": "<p>The CODECHECK register: a dataset tracking independent, reproducibility checks of scientific papers, see https://codecheck.org.uk/register/ .<\/p><p>The contributors listed with role \"Other\" are the codecheckers who conducted the checks recorded in this register. Zenodo's contributor vocabulary has no term for a reviewer or checker, so \"Other\" is used; each contributor is identified by ORCID where the register records one. See https://codecheck.org.uk/register/persons/ for the checks each of them conducted.<\/p>",
